Increasing in-context examples consistently improved Gemma-4 up to 10 shots (e.g.\ $+$0.18 GMR for German from 0-shot to 10-shot with English prompts: 0.5541$\to$0.7316).
For Gemma-3 and Mistral, few-shot examples were inconsistent and sometimes degraded performance, possibly due to prompt length effects or reduced attention to the target article as context grows.
